@host = http://localhost:5004
@proposalId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@internalKey = dev-internal-key-troque-em-producao

### 1. Login (a tela faz isso) → copia o accessToken para as rotas protegidas
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "analista", "password": "analista123" }

@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Senha errada → 401
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "analista", "password": "errada" }

### 2. Criar análise (simula o Consumer Proposta Finalizada; usa a chave interna, não JWT) → 201
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyses
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{internalKey}}

{
  "eventId": "{{$guid}}",
  "correlationId": "{{proposalId}}",
  "proposalId": "{{proposalId}}",
  "fullName": "Ana Souza",
  "taxId": "52998224725",
  "email": "ana@email.com",
  "phone": "11999998888",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-15",
  "street": "Rua A, 100",
  "city": "Sao Paulo",
  "state": "SP",
  "postalCode": "01310100",
  "motherName": "Maria Souza"
}

@analysisId = {{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Sem a chave interna → 401
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventId": "{{$guid}}", "proposalId": "{{$guid}}", "fullName": "X", "taxId": "1" }

### Replay da mesma proposta → 204 (unique index em proposalId)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyses
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{internalKey}}

{
  "eventId": "{{$guid}}",
  "correlationId": "{{proposalId}}",
  "proposalId": "{{proposalId}}",
  "fullName": "Ana Souza",
  "taxId": "52998224725"
}

### 3. Listar pendentes (sem token → 401)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/analyses?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhe
GET {{host}}/api/v1/analyses/{{analysisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Aprovar → 200 (decidedBy = "analista") e publica proposta-conta-aprovada
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyses/{{analysisId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Aprovar de novo → 409
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyses/{{analysisId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rejeitar com motivo curto → 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyses/{{analysisId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "x" }

### Rejeitar (use o id de outra análise pendente) → 200, publica proposta-conta-rejeitada
POST {{host}}/api/v1/analyses/{{analysisId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Documentos ilegiveis" }
